WEBVTT

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.280
Aruru!  Stop right now!

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:24.930
No way!

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.510
Come on!

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.740
Great job, Master!

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.180
That was spectacular, Master!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.980
What's the matter?

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.330
Ah, how should I put this...

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.270
You seem so much like a mother now.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:34.200
My.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:49.710
Nights and days cycling endlessly, hiding the radiance within

00:02:49.710 --> 00:03:00.330
Believing in the inevitable, inside the cradle of magma

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:19.870
Where was your battle?  What have you earned?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:26.520
Here by your side, I gaze at you in silence

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:34.420
Longing, waiting, summoning up a mighty perseverance

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:42.810
Losing myself in the heat of love, actions betrayed by true feelings

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:51.760
Even if the road ahead were decided by others

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:59.310
For you, I would gladly go on without complaint

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:06.740
Nights and days cycling endlessly, hiding the radiance within

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:16.000
Believing in the inevitable, born in the dark abyss

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:23.850
Inside the cradle of magma

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:36.520
<b>Vol 1. Lullaby of the Watch Tower</b>

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:37.270
The kid seems to have been abandoned by a tribal leader,

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.350
Or someone of similar status.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.860
I see.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.030
Please continue with your investigation.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:46.690
Yes.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.670
But...  Are you sure?

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:54.100
Nevermind the general, but Uruto-anesan...

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:54.970
Kurou.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.880
I've said too much.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.200
Well then.  I'm heading out.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.730
Shouldn't you be getting out soon?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.490
N-no...  Just a little longer.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.720
Really?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.820
Yay!  Bath time!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.500
Pardon me.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.490
Sis, let me bathe him today, okay?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.020
Sure.  Thank you.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.820
This feels so good.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.140
Sure does.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.960
Touka-sama!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:48.570
Fu-chan, here comes the warm water.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.910
Comfy, isn't it?

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.590
So cutesy.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.240
Touka-anechan, would you like to hold him?

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.400
C-can I?!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.810
Here.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.170
Sorry for the commotion.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.610
It's no problem at all.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.620
Tonight, allow me to keep you company.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.620
I look forward to the fish you mentioned yesterday.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.120
Sure.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.370
Fu-chan made a poop!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.750
Now he's peeing!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.750
Fumiriru-dono, please wait!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.150
Please!  Please wait!

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.000
Ah.  Master.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.700
You seem well prepared.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:52.710
Can I have some?

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.810
Sure.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.320
Are you going to keep me company, Master?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.700
Once a while, sure.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.840
My, I'm so happy.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:06.980
Hey, hey.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.960
Please take it easy on me.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.310
You sure can hold your liquor.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.220
After one cup, somehow...

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:34.760
What's the matter?

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.240
Tasty?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.690
Yeah.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.550
Wanna try some?

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:51.630
Hey now...

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:53.780
Here.  Enjoy.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:03.770
Aruru?  It's time for bed.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.470
My, my.  Isn't that too bad?

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.350
Aruru?

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.720
Sorry!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.990
E-Eruru...  This is...

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:21.280
Well...  Um...  I wanted to take a break, have a drink so...

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:27.390
Master.  Shall we wrap it up soon?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.530
K-Karura-san...

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:31.730
Right?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.350
A-ah...  Yeah.

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:38.650
Eruru, a cup of water please.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.260
Forget you!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.110
E-Eruru...

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.440
Aruru, go to sleep...

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.700
Aruru!  W-wait!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.990
Eruru, Aruru is...

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.910
Don't cry, Fu-chan...

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:34.860
Look!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:41.770
There, there.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:43.360
Food?  Peepee?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:48.610
He seems to have wet himself.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.430
I think he wants some milk.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.630
Milk!  I'll go get!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:59.930
Ah.  You guys are the only ones here?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:00.960
Where's Eruru?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.880
Collecting herbs in the mountains.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.890
I'm sorry, Fu-chan.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.770
Milk!

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:10.080
Let me take it off for now.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:13.520
It's dripping wet.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.490
It's lukewarm...

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.750
Alright.  Here.

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:36.870
Karura-oneesama, you know how to do it?

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:40.980
Um...  First I should...

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:51.070
I'm back.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.340
Welcome back.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.620
Fumi, Mama is back now.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.000
Kamyu.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.080
Yeah?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.400
Were you the one that changed Fumi's diaper?

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.290
No, it was Karura-oneesama.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.600
Karura?

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.840
Yeah.  Around lunchtime, I think.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.480
Kamyu and the others came to help out.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.330
I see.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:41.620
Karura.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.710
The moon is gorgeous tonight, isn't it?

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:54.740
Thank you for taking care of that child today.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.870
And...  Sorry about last night.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.370
Will you drink with me tonight?

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:06.820
Yes.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.620
I'm sorry!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.650
Karura...

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:32.360
That child needs a mother!

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:19.710
Oh.

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.770
You are my accomplice now.

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:31.330
Accomplice!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.290
You'll get yelled at.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.640
I don't want it...

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.040
Is Eruru scary?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:56.000
Erunga is super scary.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:16:00.580
Erunga: A spirit of the toilets.  Aruru's nickname for Eruru.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:00.580
That's true.  Erunga is a scary one.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.920
But...

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.270
I like her still.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:13.150
Sis gets mad for my sake.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.180
Oh?

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.830
Yep.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.600
Say, Aruru...

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:35.250
If everyone was separated, what would you do?

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.420
No...

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:42.710
Family, always together.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.820
Yeah.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:48.950
Family should always be together.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.980
Always together.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.550
Kamyu-chan.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.820
Do you have a moment?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:39.850
Sure.

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:46.540
Ah, Urutori-dono...

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.970
Touka-san!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.580
Ah...

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:08.780
Fumiriru is definitely the child of Atu tribe's young master and Yatamu tribe's princess.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:12.620
The tribes have been hostile towards each other for decades.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:16.830
It seems like that child was born against the will of both sides.

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.430
Seems like it...

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:23.440
And so, for that child to have a peaceful life,

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.900
The general mediated between them.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.220
I see.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.110
Tomorrow, they'll be here for the baby.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:37.810
Then Urutori-dono will...

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.430
I'll speak with Uruto.

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.740
Sorry about this, Karura.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:57.630
The one at fault is that stubborn head.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:00.410
Sir, Dori reporting!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.390
Come in.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.450
Reporting now.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.890
Urutori-sama took Fumiriru and ran away.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.970
I see.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.870
Don't worry.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.940
Mama will protect you no matter what happens.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.840
Urutori-sama, please return to the castle!

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:13.570
How did you...

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.590
There's a barrier.

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:20.960
Normally, you would have noticed it by now.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:25.900
Why...

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.880
Blinded by love, huh?

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:30.030
Even someone like you...

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.470
How could this be..?

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.780
It was my order.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.230
Sister!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.310
Why...  Why does it have to be like this?

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:46.730
You should know the answer better than anyone.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.500
Karura.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.240
Give that child back.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:58.750
Come on.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:03.000
No!

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:05.060
Come on!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.770
Urutori-dono!

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.520
This child...  This child...

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.520
Sis!

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.530
Urutori-dono...

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:30.040
This child's mama is me!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:35.050
Please stop, Urutori-dono!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:37.800
Urutori!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.230
You?  A mama?

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:48.710
Don't make me laugh!

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:55.540
What you are doing is no different than kidnapping.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.400
No, I'm this child's...

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.840
Be quiet!

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:03.130
Everyone has a place they belong to.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:06.820
But that's for themselves to decide.

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:11.820
Abducting a defenseless child like that, how can you call yourself a mother?!

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:18.550
Come on, Urutori.

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:23.390
No!  No!

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:28.840
This child is mine!  Mine!

00:22:44.390 --> 00:22:48.500
Sis...  You can't do this!

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:05.950
You are really...

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:24.150
Uruto!  Karura!

00:24:18.990 --> 00:24:20.610
Is it over?

00:24:30.470 --> 00:24:34.290
I'm sorry!  I'm sorry!

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:58.040
Quietly descending, a world devoid of color

00:24:58.040 --> 00:25:10.330
Stilling all time, drifting into slumber

00:25:11.080 --> 00:25:24.010
Sorrow, joy, gathering in the hearts of men

00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:35.500
Gazing tranquilly, at the passing of time

00:25:35.500 --> 00:25:48.440
Live and fade away, thus is the fate of men

00:25:48.440 --> 00:26:02.990
Each entrusting a gossamer wish, to a light in the night sky

00:26:02.990 --> 00:26:15.960
Softly twinkling, the sea of stars

00:26:15.960 --> 00:26:28.560
Slowly disappearing, into the horizon

00:27:31.080 --> 00:27:39.990
Casually sketching down the dream that never fades

00:27:39.990 --> 00:27:51.190
The dream of a future, unattainable without shedding away childish ways

00:27:57.360 --> 00:28:05.600
Locked up in my heart, long forgotten

00:28:05.600 --> 00:28:14.870
This dream I sketched on and on once upon a time

00:28:14.870 --> 00:28:30.020
Regretting, sighing, but time will not turn back

00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:39.450
High in the sky, soaring freely like the birds

00:28:39.450 --> 00:28:47.750
Spread my wings wide, as if embracing the whole world

00:28:47.750 --> 00:28:56.160
Wind passes by my cheeks, although a bit cold to the touch

00:28:56.160 --> 00:29:07.840
Has somehow become refreshing, in this unexplanable axiety
